# Settle the Effect Schema Observation and Reflection Contracts

## Step

Decide the canonical Effect Schemas and invariants for Observation v2, Reflection v1, EvidenceReference, ProjectorState, schema migrations, and distilled-first search results. Resolve project/workstream identity, provenance windows, sensitive-data policy, contradiction/supersession semantics, parse-failure behavior, and compatibility with existing `.svx` observation pages. Closed only when the schemas are precise enough for the shadow prototype to compile without inventing domain decisions.
